block content
    h1 Auto hide bar
    p This used to hide top bar & make secondry bar sticky

    section.source_section
        h2 Default set-up
        p Use HTMl attributes to control bars

        h3 Structure
        p this is jade template for auto hide bar
        code.src-html.source_visible.source_example
            | .auto-hide-primary-bar
            |    p Primary Bar
            | .auto-hide-secondary-bar
            |    p Secondary Bar


        markdown
            p use `auto-hide-primary-bar` for first bar and  `auto-hide-secondary-bar"` to the second



